{
  "$comment": "Tags are added to filtered events (npm run filter). 'sources' gives each source a kind tag. 'hosts' adds the real host's kind for listing platforms such as Eventbrite. 'tags' are content rules using the same syntax as filters.json (wildcard *, wholeWord). An event gets a tag when any of its patterns match title or description.",
